      "locked": false,
      "index": "b1I",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Releasing the next version of a Terraform module is hard to get right, especially the semantic version.\n\nThis flow validates which bump makes the most sense based on organizational logic and how the change will impact existing deployments,\nsays if it is ready to release, and suggests the edits that would get you there when it is not.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Releasing the next version of a Terraform module is hard to get right, especially the semantic version.\n\nThis flow validates which bump makes the most sense based on organizational logic and how the change will impact existing deployments,\nsays if it is ready to release, and suggests the edits that would get you there when it is not.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
